qualification = "The final build and verification are recorded by reference in the final matching-revision entries of /out/run/gates.jsonl, with exact revision, command, exit and private log. RUST_TEST_NOCAPTURE=1 retains all fixed-roster and roster rows. No source or record edit follows that pair."
scope = "No spec, manifest, workflow, runtime or production-handler change is made in this continuation; the inherited task changes and previous evidence are preserved. No aggregate census or redundant unchanged verification is run."

