finalize = "804628,804744,804862,804978 at height 1504; adjacent fuel per added task 7.25,7.375,7.25; endpoint slope 350/48 = 7.291666666666667."
conclusion = "Begin and finalize each add only 350 fuel while 11184 task bytes are added, consistent with one bulk byte copy and excluding the hypothesized per-participant frame walk. Their task-independent costs dominate; decision 3052 requires no speculative handler repair or continuation operation."

