[gotcha.sixteenth_opening_measurement]
observed = "The existing task-size sweep opens at height 1408 before admitting any task; recording that unchanged opening as evidence against a per-task scan would be invalid. The real following opening at 1536 refuses for every count, so four completed opening costs and its task slope remain unavailable."
interface = "DeclaredBudget::new rejects CPU above the protocol maximum; admit_activity_budget_for_qualification clamps to that maximum, and execute_authorized_v5_budgeted_for_qualification requires its token. The unbudgeted versioned seam fixes batch height to 1 and cannot execute the actual epoch-11 input. See programs/crates/layerx-programs-runtime/src/budget.rs and src/execute.rs; both are outside scope."
disposition = "The old diagnostic-budget wiring remains closed by decision 3009. No cap, test assertion, context height, state binding or runtime interface is changed to manufacture a full opening measurement. Missing completed values are reported explicitly for the owner decision."

